sequenceDiagram
    participant U as User
    participant N as TpaApp (NavState)
    participant H as HazeState
    participant B as GlassBottomBar
    participant S as Screen

    U->>N: tap Wishlist tab
    N->>N: selectTab(Wishlist) clears detail
    N->>S: recompose WishlistScreen
    S-->>H: content layer has Modifier.haze(HazeState)
    B-->>H: hazeChild registers bar bounds
    H-->>B: samples content pixels behind bar, applies blur + tint
    B-->>U: frosted bar over scrolling content
    U->>S: tap symbol card
    S->>N: openSymbol(symbol, Chart)
    N->>S: SymbolDetailScreen(symbol)
    S->>S: key(symbol) -> ChartViewModel(api, symbol)
    U->>S: tap Fundamentals
    S->>N: selectSymbolTab(Fundamentals)
    N->>S: recompose fundamentals content
